            "description_zh": "扩容比例。可能值：1~100\n\n如果作业负载需要新增10个计算节点，GrowRatio配置为50，那么会进行多轮扩容，每轮扩容当前所需的50%",
            "example": "100",
            "format": "int32",
            "type": "integer",
            "visibility": "Public"
          },
          "GrowTimeoutInMinutes": {
            "backendName": "GrowTimeoutInMinutes",
            "description_en": "The maximum hourly price of the compute nodes. The value can be accurate to three decimal places. The parameter takes effect only when SpotStrategy is set to SpotWithPriceLimit",
            "description_zh": "扩容超时时间，等待启动节点的超时时间。单位：分钟，可能值：10~60\n\n如果扩容时间大于扩容超时时间，节点依然未达到运行状态，系统将此节点释放",
            "example": "20",
            "format": "int32",
            "type": "integer",
            "visibility": "Public"
          },
          "ImageId": {
            "backendName": "ImageId",
